msgid "This package provides the Mesa OpenGL Utility library."
msgstr "Esse pacote fornece a biblioteca &quot;OpenGL Utility&quot; do Mesa."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><note><para>
#: blfs-en/x/lib/glu.xml:33
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"If you have installed <ulink url=\"https://glfs-"
"book.github.io/glfs/shareddeps/libglvnd.html\">libglvnd</ulink>, please "
"install the GLFS version of <ulink url=\"https://glfs-"
"book.github.io/glfs/shareddeps/glu.html\">GLU</ulink> instead so that the "
"library functions as expected."
msgstr ""
"Se você tiver instalado a <ulink url=\"https://glfs-"
"book.github.io/glfs/shareddeps/libglvnd.html\">libglvnd</ulink>, por favor, "
"instale a versão GLFS da <ulink url=\"https://glfs-"
"book.github.io/glfs/shareddeps/glu.html\">GLU</ulink> de forma que a "
"biblioteca funcione como esperado."

